WEBVTT

00:00:01.310 --> 00:00:02.150
Wait! Ah!

00:00:02.150 --> 00:00:15.330
Are you okay?

00:00:15.330 --> 00:00:17.750
Thank you very much.

00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:21.310
You look pale and you look like you're having a hard time, but are you okay?

00:00:21.310 --> 00:00:22.710
I'm fine.

00:00:22.710 --> 00:00:23.750
No, no, no, no, no, no.

00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:26.650
You don't look okay.

00:00:26.650 --> 00:00:29.030
Yes, for the time being, drink some water.

00:00:30.060 --> 00:00:35.290
I hate oaks.

00:00:35.290 --> 00:00:38.510
Even so, why are you alone in a place like this?

00:00:38.510 --> 00:00:42.600
It's dangerous for ordinary people to come to the forest without paying 5 yen.

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:45.990
I'm an adventurer for the time being.

00:00:45.990 --> 00:00:47.800
Is that so?

00:00:47.800 --> 00:00:53.660
It seems that oaks are weak, so this is the second time.

00:00:53.660 --> 00:00:56.090
It's so easy to like.

00:00:56.090 --> 00:00:57.530
I wonder why.

00:00:57.530 --> 00:01:00.000
You're about the same age as me, aren't you?

00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:07.080
敬語はやめようよ僕はルリ俺はアルウェインよろしくアル君

00:02:01.180 --> 00:02:03.810
If that's the case, raise your hands

00:02:03.810 --> 00:02:05.810
Instead of searching for the path

00:02:05.810 --> 00:02:08.810
Just knock on the new door

00:02:08.810 --> 00:02:12.070
The rainy season is coming

00:02:12.070 --> 00:02:15.380
Life will turn around and look out for you

00:02:15.380 --> 00:02:17.380
From now on, the sunshine will touch you

00:02:17.380 --> 00:02:20.380
Without hesitation, to the future

00:02:20.380 --> 00:02:26.280
If you know it...

00:02:38.960 --> 00:02:41.300
So, where were you going?

00:02:41.300 --> 00:02:43.770
Oh, I was on my way to Lurgus.

00:02:43.770 --> 00:02:45.790
Really? Me too!

00:02:45.790 --> 00:02:47.470
Why don't we go together?

00:02:47.470 --> 00:02:48.530
Are you sure?

00:02:48.530 --> 00:02:49.810
Of course!

00:02:49.810 --> 00:02:52.360
It'll be hard if you get attacked by orcs again.

00:02:52.360 --> 00:02:53.900
Oh, but...

00:02:53.900 --> 00:02:57.010
Isn't it bad to go on a two-person trip with a man?

00:02:57.010 --> 00:02:58.350
Why?

00:02:58.350 --> 00:03:00.000
Even from here...

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:03.440
It's not the distance of a day, and of course it's Nojuku with the two of us.

00:03:03.440 --> 00:03:05.120
Oh, that one?

00:03:05.120 --> 00:03:06.720
It's okay.

00:03:06.720 --> 00:03:11.490
The moment you tried to reach out to me, your neck was flying.

00:03:11.490 --> 00:03:12.680
Hmm...

00:03:12.680 --> 00:03:15.560
Nah, it's a joke.

00:03:15.560 --> 00:03:17.860
You don't look like you're doing that.

00:03:17.860 --> 00:03:19.400
Why do you think so?

00:03:19.400 --> 00:03:23.410
I'm not cute, so I'm not worried.

00:03:23.410 --> 00:03:26.560
What? No, no, it's cute enough.

00:03:26.560 --> 00:03:30.000
Really?

00:03:30.890 --> 00:03:31.800
I'm so happy!

00:03:31.800 --> 00:03:32.700
Thank you!

00:03:32.700 --> 00:03:34.980
But it's not sausage...

00:03:34.980 --> 00:03:43.700
If I say "It's not sausage" here, he'll be annoyed, and if I say "It's sausage, hahaha!" he'll be annoyed...

00:03:43.700 --> 00:03:50.070
By the way, if we don't go now, more people will come.

00:03:50.070 --> 00:03:52.150
Oh, that's right.

00:03:52.150 --> 00:03:54.070
Let's go to Rurik's!

00:03:54.070 --> 00:03:56.080
Oh, oh, oh!

00:04:00.190 --> 00:04:02.950
I feel like a monster is going to appear.

00:04:02.950 --> 00:04:05.320
If you say that, it's a promise.

00:04:05.320 --> 00:04:24.510
Something's coming!

00:04:24.510 --> 00:04:25.220
It's a letter.

00:04:32.810 --> 00:05:00.000
いや探しましたよなんでこんなところまで魔獣がいるクリムの森だぞ仕事ですからしかもまた母さんからだしではご苦労様休養いや実は割とすごい量だね

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:02.660
I thought it would be better to show my face

00:05:02.660 --> 00:05:05.820
I went to Lulugs, where my parents live

00:05:05.820 --> 00:05:07.040
What is it?

00:05:07.040 --> 00:05:11.200
Well, the original purpose is to collect fertilizer

00:05:11.200 --> 00:05:13.120
Collect fertilizer?

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:17.000
To make sweet tomatoes, you need good fertilizer, right?

00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:19.660
Lulugs uses the fertilizer to grow rice

00:05:19.660 --> 00:05:23.520
Isn't it amazing? I also use seawater, but I didn't have that idea

00:05:23.520 --> 00:05:26.080
As you know, the nutrients of tomatoes are 2.5 times the amount of cabbage

00:05:26.080 --> 00:05:28.230
I'm an organic, so tell me it's 2.5 times

00:05:28.230 --> 00:05:30.000
Oh, sorry, sorry

00:05:30.480 --> 00:05:32.740
How's your family?

00:05:32.740 --> 00:05:35.670
You're worried about traveling alone, aren't you?

00:05:35.670 --> 00:05:38.170
I'm totally fine.

00:05:38.170 --> 00:05:41.950
No one is worried about me.

00:05:41.950 --> 00:05:45.500
Oh, is that so?

00:05:45.500 --> 00:05:46.480
Oh?

00:05:46.480 --> 00:05:48.820
Let's take a look around here today.

00:05:48.820 --> 00:05:51.000
That's right. It's already sunset.

00:05:51.000 --> 00:05:52.710
Isn't that strange?

00:05:52.710 --> 00:05:57.040
You don't usually put a tent in such a small bag, do you?

00:05:57.040 --> 00:05:58.400
Oh, this?

00:05:58.400 --> 00:06:00.000
I don't know the principle well either.

00:06:00.090 --> 00:06:05.230
It doesn't look like it, but it seems to have more storage than it looks, and it's in good condition.

00:06:05.230 --> 00:06:08.800
In good condition? What kind of thing is that?

00:06:08.800 --> 00:06:12.000
It's one of the things I've received from my ancestors.

00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:14.500
Ruri's ancestors?

00:06:14.500 --> 00:06:17.230
Uh, my ancestors...

00:06:17.230 --> 00:06:20.960
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:06:20.960 --> 00:06:22.400
Let's have a meal.

00:06:22.400 --> 00:06:27.820
It's delicious! This is really good!

00:06:27.820 --> 00:06:30.000
Isn't it? It's my favorite dish.

00:06:30.440 --> 00:06:33.880
The harmony of potatoes and the sweetness of nymphs!

00:06:33.880 --> 00:06:40.180
In the past, the sweetness of potatoes was different depending on the fertilization and the cultivation methods, but by revitalizing the microorganisms in the soil...

00:06:40.180 --> 00:06:41.160
A-Arkun!

00:06:41.160 --> 00:06:42.150
Ouch!

00:06:42.150 --> 00:06:45.260
Ah, sorry! I just couldn't stop...

00:06:45.260 --> 00:06:49.060
By the way, Ruri, why are you heading to Rurugus?

00:06:49.060 --> 00:06:53.630
Me? I'm traveling to train myself.

00:06:53.630 --> 00:06:58.590
So I heard a strange rumor from a merchant around Rurugus.

00:06:58.590 --> 00:07:00.000
Rumor?

00:07:00.060 --> 00:07:04.870
An unknown accident occurred, and the victim is witnessing a demon tribe.

00:07:04.870 --> 00:07:08.600
That's scary. What's wrong with that demon tribe?

00:07:08.600 --> 00:07:10.180
The location and details...

00:07:10.180 --> 00:07:13.620
That's what everyone doesn't remember.

00:07:13.620 --> 00:07:16.570
With just that rumor, the guild won't be able to move.

00:07:16.570 --> 00:07:21.530
I'm free to move, so I thought I'd go investigate.

00:07:21.530 --> 00:07:23.780
Isn't that dangerous?

00:07:23.780 --> 00:07:26.680
Why is Ruri going all the way there?

00:07:26.680 --> 00:07:29.860
Actually, I...

00:07:30.700 --> 00:07:33.290
I am the descendant of a hero.

00:07:33.290 --> 00:07:36.660
I see. A hero...

00:07:36.660 --> 00:07:41.120
A hero! You defeated the Demon King Macbeth!

00:07:41.120 --> 00:07:46.390
I met the descendant of a hero who was unknown.

00:07:46.390 --> 00:07:52.730
So I'm going to do something with the power of the hero who was inherited from your ancestors.

00:07:52.730 --> 00:07:56.010
That's my job.

00:07:56.010 --> 00:07:58.010
Is that okay?

00:07:58.010 --> 00:07:59.190
What?

00:07:59.190 --> 00:08:00.000
The descendant of a hero...

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:03.170
But it doesn't make a difference to a girl.

00:08:03.170 --> 00:08:25.560
If anything happens...

00:08:25.560 --> 00:08:30.000
If I made you feel bad, I'm sorry.

00:08:30.280 --> 00:08:33.080
Ah, no, no, no, no, it's not like that!

00:08:33.080 --> 00:08:34.800
I was just surprised.

00:08:34.800 --> 00:08:37.350
You thought about me, didn't you?

00:08:37.350 --> 00:08:38.610
Thank you.

00:08:38.610 --> 00:08:40.720
Ohoho.

00:08:40.720 --> 00:08:42.140
Now then, let's go.

00:08:42.140 --> 00:08:45.360
It's about time for us to rest.

00:08:45.360 --> 00:08:47.960
Ah, that's right.

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:48.960
Hm?

00:08:48.960 --> 00:08:51.780
Eh? Are you going to sleep on the ground?

00:08:51.780 --> 00:08:53.280
Of course.

00:08:53.280 --> 00:08:55.780
I can't sleep with you.

00:08:55.780 --> 00:08:57.140
It's not a big deal.

00:08:57.140 --> 00:09:00.000
If you sleep on the ground, when you wake up in the morning, your neck...

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:02.020
Your shoulder will hurt.

00:09:02.020 --> 00:09:04.210
You'll get better after you get older.

00:09:04.210 --> 00:09:06.360
I think it's better to have a tent.

00:09:06.360 --> 00:09:10.680
Besides, I think it's okay for you to walk.

00:09:10.680 --> 00:09:13.530
No, no. No matter how bad it is, it's not good.

00:09:13.530 --> 00:09:15.530
You trust me too much.

00:09:15.530 --> 00:09:18.450
But I'm confident in my intuition.

00:09:18.450 --> 00:09:20.620
Well, it's okay.

00:09:20.620 --> 00:09:22.620
There may be a lot of people around here.

00:09:22.620 --> 00:09:25.600
What? A lot of people?

00:09:25.600 --> 00:09:28.320
Excuse me.

00:09:30.510 --> 00:09:32.660
I don't need a sleeping bag.

00:09:32.660 --> 00:09:34.740
Just sleep here.

00:09:34.740 --> 00:09:37.810
And why are there two of you?

00:09:37.810 --> 00:09:42.990
When I was traveling, I dreamed of sleeping with someone.

00:09:42.990 --> 00:09:45.170
What kind of dream is that?

00:09:45.170 --> 00:09:48.120
Well, if that's all, I'll go with you.

00:09:48.120 --> 00:09:51.440
Then let's talk until we go to bed.

00:09:51.440 --> 00:09:57.240
So what kind of story do you want to talk about?

00:09:57.240 --> 00:10:00.000
I'm not good at capocha.

00:10:00.120 --> 00:10:03.880
Then, Ruri?

00:10:03.880 --> 00:10:05.970
I'm sleeping.

00:10:05.970 --> 00:10:07.800
You weren't talking to me, were you?

00:10:07.800 --> 00:10:13.170
Like in your dreams.

00:10:13.170 --> 00:10:17.050
Good night.

00:10:17.050 --> 00:10:25.830
Okay.

00:10:25.830 --> 00:10:26.690
Hey!

00:10:26.690 --> 00:10:30.000
What are you doing here?

00:10:30.060 --> 00:10:33.780
Uh, um... Um, um...

00:10:33.780 --> 00:10:35.700
I'm so angry!

00:10:35.700 --> 00:10:45.460
That's Rurik's.

00:10:45.460 --> 00:10:48.420
That's right. What's wrong with that figure?

00:10:48.420 --> 00:10:50.480
Ruri is so...

00:10:50.480 --> 00:10:54.280
But, is this the first time you've seen Rurik's?

00:10:54.280 --> 00:11:00.000
Yeah, I've been in the village all this time. I used to go out to sell vegetables to the royal family.

00:11:00.120 --> 00:11:04.870
What? Really?

00:11:04.870 --> 00:11:09.610
I just started recently.

00:11:09.610 --> 00:11:10.610
Ahaha.

00:11:10.610 --> 00:11:14.040
It's dangerous if you don't follow me. I'm still a newcomer.

00:11:14.040 --> 00:11:16.210
That's right.

00:11:16.210 --> 00:11:22.000
Is it okay to do it for the first time?

00:11:22.000 --> 00:11:24.000
Yeah, it'll work out somehow.

00:11:24.000 --> 00:11:26.160
Well then, I'll say goodbye here.

00:11:26.160 --> 00:11:27.160
Yeah.

00:11:27.160 --> 00:11:28.010
You saved me.

00:11:28.010 --> 00:11:28.930
Thank you, Rudy.

00:11:28.930 --> 00:11:29.940
Oh.

00:11:30.570 --> 00:11:35.540
It was the first time I went on a trip with someone.

00:11:35.540 --> 00:11:40.560
It wasn't like a trip this time, but it was a lot of fun!

00:11:40.560 --> 00:11:46.700
- Ruri... - So if we have another chance...

00:11:46.700 --> 00:11:52.180
- Can I ask for a escort? - What?

00:11:52.180 --> 00:11:57.100
I'll stay here for a few days, and then I'll go back to the capital.

00:11:57.100 --> 00:11:59.670
So after Ruri's investigation is over...

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:06.620
I'd like to ask you to escort me home.

00:12:06.620 --> 00:12:08.040
I'll write down where I'm going.

00:12:08.040 --> 00:12:10.490
If you decide to go home, will you come to let me know?

00:12:10.490 --> 00:12:11.720
Yeah, I got it.

00:12:11.720 --> 00:12:14.050
By the way, you don't have to write so much.

00:12:14.050 --> 00:12:14.620
What?

00:12:14.620 --> 00:12:16.440
But if I get lost, it'll be a big deal.

00:12:16.440 --> 00:12:17.990
It's okay.

00:12:17.990 --> 00:12:21.370
This!

00:12:21.370 --> 00:12:23.260
Look forward!

00:12:23.260 --> 00:12:30.000
First of all,

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:32.270
Let's show our faces to our parents.

00:12:32.270 --> 00:12:34.840
Demons...

00:12:34.840 --> 00:12:37.440
I've never heard of such a rumor.

00:12:37.440 --> 00:12:42.050
This is a small town, so if something like that happens, it should spread right away.

00:12:42.050 --> 00:12:43.290
Is that so?

00:12:43.290 --> 00:12:45.980
Thank you very much.

00:12:45.980 --> 00:12:51.380
No matter who I ask, I can't find anyone who witnessed the demons, let alone the injured.

00:12:51.380 --> 00:12:54.900
Was the merchant's story a lie in the first place?

00:12:54.900 --> 00:12:57.120
If that's the case, that's fine, but...

00:12:57.120 --> 00:12:59.000
You useless!

00:13:00.280 --> 00:13:06.650
In spite of being a warrior's disciple!

00:13:06.650 --> 00:13:08.580
I have to investigate more thoroughly!

00:13:17.340 --> 00:13:21.950
A family suddenly kidnapped my sister!

00:13:21.950 --> 00:13:24.730
A family? Do you know where they went to?

00:13:24.730 --> 00:13:29.570
Yes, it's the forest in the front yard. Please help my sister!

00:13:30.830 --> 00:13:33.090
The rumors about Madoka were true.

00:13:33.090 --> 00:13:35.860
It's okay. Leave it to me.

00:13:35.860 --> 00:13:45.730
Where is it?

00:13:45.730 --> 00:13:48.760
I'll ring the bell.

00:13:48.760 --> 00:13:50.550
What?

00:14:16.120 --> 00:14:19.300
My family was full of anger, and it opened the curtain on my stay at my parents' house.

00:14:19.300 --> 00:14:29.960
My mother, of course, has the value of cooking and washing, but thanks to her kind and energetic personality, she is good at getting along with people.

00:14:30.280 --> 00:14:32.820
My son is also a beautiful woman.

00:14:32.820 --> 00:14:35.390
But!

00:14:35.390 --> 00:14:36.870
There's one thing.

00:14:36.870 --> 00:14:38.680
He's an idiot!

00:14:38.680 --> 00:14:44.240
Sir, I'm in pain, so please let me go.

00:14:44.240 --> 00:14:46.230
I'm so grateful.

00:14:46.230 --> 00:14:49.750
You're still lying to me, aren't you?

00:14:49.750 --> 00:15:00.000
What the hell are you doing to a woman's wife?

00:15:05.560 --> 00:15:08.140
I don't know who you are, but you're so brave!

00:15:08.140 --> 00:15:08.910
You!

00:15:08.910 --> 00:15:10.010
What?

00:15:10.010 --> 00:15:16.260
Do you know what you just did?

00:15:16.260 --> 00:15:22.310
Eh? Um... There was a man who helped me out in Russia, so I'm very grateful.

00:15:22.310 --> 00:15:25.280
It's me, Dad!

00:15:25.280 --> 00:15:26.920
What?

00:15:26.920 --> 00:15:30.000
Do you have it? Hit me.

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:35.160
If I'm alive, I'll be happy again.

00:15:35.160 --> 00:15:40.240
This son-in-law's mother and wife-in-law's father are my parents.

00:15:40.240 --> 00:15:46.520
I made a lot of them.

00:15:46.520 --> 00:15:49.290
You made it too much.

00:15:49.290 --> 00:15:51.000
This is delicious, too.

00:15:51.000 --> 00:15:53.040
Here you go.

00:15:53.040 --> 00:15:55.710
I can eat it by myself.

00:15:55.710 --> 00:16:00.000
Mom, is this my rice?

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:05.240
I tried to make it to my favorite taste, but it wasn't good!

00:16:05.240 --> 00:16:10.020
Ruri's cooking was also good, but my mom's taste is the best.

00:16:10.020 --> 00:16:14.490
Oh, thank you. It was worth shaking my arm.

00:16:14.490 --> 00:16:18.050
By the way, who knows Ruri?

00:16:18.050 --> 00:16:20.400
What kind of relationship is it to eat home-cooked food?

00:16:20.400 --> 00:16:22.110
Is it more than a friend?

00:16:22.110 --> 00:16:26.430
You're not the one who likes it, are you?

00:16:26.430 --> 00:16:30.000
R2 finally got a girlfriend!

00:16:30.030 --> 00:16:35.030
I see, I see. Get married and have children! Then I'll be able to...

00:16:36.030 --> 00:16:39.030
Mother's box... Argentine Backflicker!

00:16:39.980 --> 00:16:42.980
I'm not done yet! I'm not done yet!

00:16:42.980 --> 00:16:44.980
I'm not done yet! I'm not done yet!

00:16:44.980 --> 00:16:46.980
Mother! Father!

00:16:46.980 --> 00:16:49.750
I'm not done yet! I'm not done yet!

00:16:49.750 --> 00:16:54.660
Ruri is the one who came here to support me! That's all!

00:16:54.660 --> 00:16:55.660
What?

00:16:55.660 --> 00:16:59.010
It seems like Mother went to the market early.

00:16:59.010 --> 00:17:00.000
Come on, come on.

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:05.870
I can't remember anyone else with this strength.

00:17:05.870 --> 00:17:09.470
Haru, weren't you thinking about the girl again?

00:17:09.470 --> 00:17:13.310
I'm not thinking about her! I'm feeling it!

00:17:13.310 --> 00:17:14.650
To be honest...

00:17:14.650 --> 00:17:16.230
I'm telling the truth!

00:17:16.230 --> 00:17:18.890
Mom, don't do that!

00:17:18.890 --> 00:17:25.000
Haru, if you didn't follow me, your father would have died by now.

00:17:25.000 --> 00:17:26.120
Thank you.

00:17:26.120 --> 00:17:28.170
He's already almost dead.

00:17:28.170 --> 00:17:29.700
That idiot.

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:31.970
It's a lot better than before, isn't it?

00:17:31.970 --> 00:17:35.230
Yeah, when I was living away from you,

00:17:35.230 --> 00:17:37.270
I had a hard time persuading you.

00:17:37.270 --> 00:17:40.970
If my father wasn't here, I wouldn't have been able to live on my own.

00:17:40.970 --> 00:17:44.880
So you came to this town for a reason, didn't you?

00:17:44.880 --> 00:17:46.800
I'm looking for a scapegoat.

00:17:46.800 --> 00:17:48.530
They say it's good for healing.

00:17:48.530 --> 00:17:51.960
If that's the case, there was a donation center in the suburbs.

00:17:51.960 --> 00:17:54.190
I think you can split it up there.

00:17:54.190 --> 00:17:55.350
Really?

00:17:55.350 --> 00:17:58.390
Um, where is this map?

00:17:58.390 --> 00:18:00.000
Um...

00:18:00.120 --> 00:18:04.420
This is here, so it's here.

00:18:04.420 --> 00:18:08.840
Hey, Aru, what's this mark?

00:18:08.840 --> 00:18:12.240
It's the hotel where the guard I just talked to is staying.

00:18:12.240 --> 00:18:14.150
I thought I'd ask you to go home, too.

00:18:14.150 --> 00:18:16.010
Hotel?

00:18:16.010 --> 00:18:18.780
Is there a hotel in a place like this?

00:18:18.780 --> 00:18:21.100
Did you make it before you noticed?

00:18:21.100 --> 00:18:24.730
I went through it the other day, but I didn't notice.

00:18:24.730 --> 00:18:30.000
Come to think of it, it seems that there are a lot of unknown accidents around here, but do you know anything about them?

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:31.900
An unknown cause of the accident?

00:18:31.900 --> 00:18:34.480
It seems that the demon clan is involved.

00:18:34.480 --> 00:18:37.430
No, I don't hear such rumors.

00:18:37.430 --> 00:18:41.190
In the first place, I haven't seen the demon clan myself recently.

00:18:41.190 --> 00:18:44.320
First of all, if there is such a damage, Lusica will...

00:18:44.320 --> 00:18:47.090
Mom? What happened to your mother?

00:18:47.090 --> 00:18:49.130
No, no, no, it's nothing.

00:18:49.130 --> 00:18:50.550
It's nothing.

00:18:50.550 --> 00:18:53.880
More than that, you're going to Seien Castle tomorrow, right?

00:18:53.880 --> 00:18:54.480
Yeah.

00:18:54.480 --> 00:18:56.560
Shouldn't you take a break soon?

00:18:56.560 --> 00:18:58.500
Yeah, you should definitely take a break.

00:18:58.500 --> 00:18:59.570
I see.

00:19:00.060 --> 00:19:01.950
Well, good night.

00:19:01.950 --> 00:19:03.370
Ah, good night.

00:19:03.370 --> 00:19:04.740
Ah, Aru!

00:19:04.740 --> 00:19:06.460
That's my dad's bed.

00:19:06.460 --> 00:19:09.570
Well, when I went to my room just now,

00:19:09.570 --> 00:19:11.410
my mom was on the bed.

00:19:11.410 --> 00:19:15.780
I don't feel like I can sleep in such a scary space.

00:19:15.780 --> 00:19:17.070
Huh?

00:19:17.070 --> 00:19:18.890
So, you're hiding, right?

00:19:18.890 --> 00:19:20.150
Good night.

00:19:20.150 --> 00:19:21.350
Hey, wait!

00:19:21.350 --> 00:19:23.590
You're going to get angry tomorrow, dad!

00:19:23.590 --> 00:19:25.680
Aru, hey, don't sleep, Aru!

00:19:25.680 --> 00:19:26.820
Wake up, Aru!

00:19:26.820 --> 00:19:28.890
Hey, wake up!

00:19:28.890 --> 00:19:30.000
Alright!

00:19:30.890 --> 00:19:33.590
I got it!

00:19:33.590 --> 00:19:39.590
Now that we've achieved our goal, let's go to the hotel where Ruri is staying.

00:19:39.590 --> 00:19:44.680
The demon clan is here!

00:19:44.680 --> 00:19:47.870
Are you okay?

00:19:47.870 --> 00:19:55.320
I was attacked by the demon clan, and I managed to escape while the blue-haired girl was fighting.

00:19:55.320 --> 00:19:56.310
What is it?

00:19:56.310 --> 00:20:00.000
It's a forest beyond the south gate.

00:20:30.830 --> 00:20:32.440
You didn't have any answer, did you?

00:20:32.440 --> 00:20:37.820
Um...

00:20:37.820 --> 00:20:40.970
That's...

00:20:40.970 --> 00:20:42.650
Oh, that's...

00:20:42.650 --> 00:20:43.920
I...

00:20:43.920 --> 00:20:45.000
I'm a strong person.

00:20:45.000 --> 00:20:46.040
I'm a strong person.

00:20:46.040 --> 00:20:47.120
I'm a strong person.

00:20:53.740 --> 00:20:55.490
What the hell are they?

00:20:55.490 --> 00:20:57.070
What about the woman from before?

00:20:57.070 --> 00:20:58.980
This is the real figure.

00:20:58.980 --> 00:21:00.000
It was disguised as a person.

00:21:00.600 --> 00:21:05.410
There are a lot of the same monsters in this forest, so there's no point in defeating them all!

00:21:05.410 --> 00:21:08.260
Ruri, were you fighting alone all this time?

00:21:08.260 --> 00:21:13.310
That's because that's my role!

00:21:13.310 --> 00:21:15.300
Well done, well done.

00:21:15.300 --> 00:21:17.550
You're the one from before?

00:21:17.550 --> 00:21:20.230
The merchant who told me the rumor!

00:21:20.230 --> 00:21:22.200
As expected of a hero's descendant.

00:21:22.200 --> 00:21:27.620
I want to call you brave, but didn't you think it was strange?

00:21:27.620 --> 00:21:29.320
What do you mean?

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:37.000
There's no one in the village who hasn't seen any demons, but there's someone who's been attacked by demons in front of you.

00:21:37.000 --> 00:21:38.350
No way!

00:21:38.350 --> 00:21:40.890
You've finally realized it.

00:21:40.890 --> 00:21:45.930
A foolish person like you can't save anyone!

00:21:45.930 --> 00:21:51.880
I'm disqualified as a hero.

00:21:51.880 --> 00:21:59.700
As it is.

00:22:01.980 --> 00:22:11.620
I can't be a fool, if it's the limit, I'll just roll my soul. If that's all I can do, I can't help it. I don't have to stop, I don't have to stop.
